2026-02-10 01:01:01,378 - DocumentGraderNode - INFO: Retrieved document Short Call Option

As its name indicates, a short call option is the opposite of a long call option. In a short call option, the seller promises to sell their shares at a fixed strike price in the future. Short call options are mainly used for covered calls by the option seller, or call options in which the seller already owns the underlying stock for their options. is relevant
